{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532157/", "pk": 532157, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/", "pk": 110654, "shortname": "sixfinscharter", "name": "Six Fins Boat Charter - Perry Marina", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Private Romantic Sunset Cruise", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 3, "unicode": "Private Romantic Sunset Cruise", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 2.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 2.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 968, "description": "#Embark on an unforgettable journey as the sun dips below the horizon, casting vibrant hues across the endless expanse of the ocean. \n\n##About\nOur Sunset Cruise in Key West is a magical experience. In the company of loved ones, you'll witness nature's masterpiece. Glide effortlessly through the tranquil waters aboard our luxurious charter boat, soaking in the breathtaking views and savoring the moment's serenity. Let the gentle sea breeze caress your skin as you toast another perfect day in paradise. This is not just a cruise; it's a symphony of colors and emotions that will leave you spellbound.\n\n##Complimentary\nAll charter passengers may use The Perry Hotel and Marina pools & gym as my guests before and after the charter. David, Owner", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, Fl.", "booking_notes": "IMPORTANT ACTION REQUIRED\nSix Fins Charter – Romantic Sunset Cruise Confirmation\n\nDear Guests,\n\nWe’re honored to welcome you aboard your Romantic Sunset Cruise — a private 3-hour evening experience designed to capture Key West at its most magical.\n\nPlease review the important details below to ensure a seamless and unforgettable evening on the water.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n✅ Before Your Cruise\n\nFor trips up to six passengers:\n\n👉 Each passenger must complete the insurance waiver (including adults on behalf of minors): [here] (https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/rd9k5tiavpwper7h2rhaqh/web/)\n\nAND for trips with 7th and 8th passengers:\n\n👉 The primary renter (21+ years old) and captain must complete the Bareboat Agreement together at the dock before departure, but prior to arrival, you may begin: [here](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/ez5636zbxexwrng7dtz6mq/web/)\n\nPlease complete all required forms prior to arrival so we may depart on time.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🌅 Your Romantic Sunset Experience\n\nThis is a private 3-hour sunset charter designed for intimacy, elegance, and uninterrupted views.\n\nPossible scenic routes may include areas near:\n\n• Mallory Square Harbor\n• Sunset Key\n• Tank Island\n• Wisteria Island\n• Open Gulf horizon views\n\nYour captain selects the ideal sunset location based on wind and cloud conditions to ensure the most spectacular vantage point.\n\nRelax, play your favorite music, bring champagne, and watch the sky transform into brilliant hues of gold, rose, and violet.\n\nPlease note: Sunset timing, cloud cover, and color intensity vary daily and cannot be guaranteed — but every evening on the water is uniquely beautiful.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🛥 Departure Details\n\nDock A, Slip #32\n7001 Shrimp Rd\nStock Island, FL 33040\n\nFree parking is available adjacent to The Perry Hotel & Marina.\nPlease arrive 15 minutes prior to departure.\n\nBoat:\n30' Jeanneau NC 895 Weekender\nPrivate enclosed head (toilet)\nUSCG-certified safety equipment\nLicensed USCG captains\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🧳 What’s Included\n\n• Cooler with ice\n• Bottled water & light snacks\n• Comfortable seating\n• Panoramic sunset viewing\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🚫 Not Included\n\n• Meals & beverages (BYOB welcome)\n• Towels\n• Infant/toddler USCG-approved life jackets (must be provided by guest)\n• Captain & crew gratuity (customary 20% minimum if satisfied)\n\nOpen flames (candles, sparklers, etc.) are not permitted onboard.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🩺 Health & Safety\n\nYour safety is our highest priority.\n\n• Operated by U.S. Coast Guard–licensed captains\n• Safety briefing provided prior to departure\n• U.S. Coast Guard–approved life jackets available\n• Routes selected based on wind and sea conditions\n• Food allergies or dietary restrictions: reply to this email and let us know in advance so we can prepare.\n• Prone to seasickness: tell us ahead of time and we'll suggest what to take before boarding.\n\nGuests should be in good general health and able to board the vessel with minimal assistance.\n\nExcessive intoxication or unsafe behavior may result in denial of boarding or early termination without refund.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n⚠ Disclaimers\n\n• Sunset visibility and color intensity vary daily\n• All itineraries are subject to weather and captain discretion\n• Wildlife sightings cannot be guaranteed\n• Late arrivals may reduce charter time\n• Six Fins is not responsible for lost or damaged personal items\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🎁 Complimentary Access\n\nAs my charter guests, you may enjoy access to The Perry Hotel & Marina pools and fitness center before and after your cruise.\n\nMake it a full evening.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\nWe look forward to sharing a beautiful Key West sunset with you.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nDavid McFadden\nOwner, Six Fins Charter", "cancellation_notes": "Enjoy peace of mind with our cancellation policy:\n\nAll reservations made within 7 calendar days of departure are non-refundable. Customer cancellations made prior to 7 calendar days before departure will receive a full refund. If Six Fins Charter cancels due to unsafe weather conditions or other circumstances initiated by the owner/operator, the customer will receive a full refund.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Three hours for two or up to six on the Atlantic horizon", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532157/images/1157783/", "pk": 1157783, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dUz5aAyR9CR0PeWgW3Jj", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dUz5aAyR9CR0PeWgW3Jj", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532157/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dUz5aAyR9CR0PeWgW3Jj", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dUz5aAyR9CR0PeWgW3Jj", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532157/images/1228453/", "pk": 1228453, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XqwQ1QzQQqeMi1AGxnjl", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XqwQ1QzQQqeMi1AGxnjl", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532157/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https: